<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-22T00:32:07.809Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:32:07 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Houthis have launched missile attacks toward Riyadh and southern Saudi Arabia, while the Saudi-led coalition has intercepted three of those missiles and warned airlines to avoid Saudi airspace. Saudi-backed forces have struck a Yemeni port, prompting the Houthis to threaten to bomb key Saudi ports in retaliation. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168830&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTE1mUmVmcDhLZFlILWJKS1dhWm9JM0ZtT0xselpHTUl6T1JIcFVwejczUDk5SHk3UUZ6Zk9FRm1tcXlNUnNRTWZnRHJ2LWcxcnJxQldGUm5lVWZNUkJ1aEIwZjFmbWtoWF9XbjE1c0tmUWpqdlFT?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxOWVJtZHNEeHFsOERJVHRnZnV4Qy11aHNRMTZrSV9mTkV5VGlzUW11OWJBc0FGQkREZEJ3dngwalJqTDJramc4NUI0QVJvVVppaktQLVJKMHRTSDkzeHlsQ2RxYXlhNlgzelR3VHlYVXVaY1lwT3lxLW5rS3lYZzF1c05iTFFYbGVDWXFyd2M5aDc5OUJldy13N21JQzVtSGdwUmoteEJucGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPb3pQREZDSHE2RmNHdDdGdExDUXhYeWljc2VualVoQ09oQV90WnFQQlZkYW1rWnl5ODJ6N2haaVBDVUY4VmFvRmtLSlZKbU5kR1lHNklrUUR3X3JGc181OHZCUHpXalZFUllBZXVEczJPUUdZZUt1MmpsTEN0MkJGSDNCVHhoa25pZFBSb1lldS1US0VJNVNBWWN1U2VwQmd0WmlQR1RKWmgyS2lyUDVfNHdWeWhzaFhmZ1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxNQUE1UEFGeklRZGtscWJhNkdxRWpyWHkwQ29IcVQ1Umc2VHlkWlJGZzZPTC00SFl2a3J0SXY3TGo0X0t2a3A5ckMzbmtZXy1mYzdoa0F5Vmo1TGFaU1RIbEZHak5iTi1oRXhWWF9CbWZ2QWFLRG1HSG5Rc1dSbHZlaGNNSDlvZ2RiekJzbnpqMC1aektLZU1MSHBWN25